{
  "$schema": "../../schema/recipe.schema.json",
  "name": "wheatpaste-mark",
  "description": "Wheatpaste, mark knockout: the mark huge, cut out of a pink sheet pasted over a photo, the name full width under it; glue creases. Square (release): the mark top left, the title cut out beside it, the name across the foot. Re-expressed from the Logomarks scenes lab (ZineCards, 'Wheatpaste · mark knockout').",
